quared, minus 2 x, plus 7"></span>. Combining like terms yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/60fdb4d4/img_007_fc8ea4e7.png" alt="5 x squared, minus 2 x, plus 3"></span>.<p>Choices B, C, and D are incorrect and may be the result of errors when applying the distributive property.</p><p><!--EndFragment--></p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>
