th\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/60fdb4d4/img_003_b7ec684f.png\" alt=\"negative x squared plus 2 x minus 11\"></span></span></p>\n"}],"keys":null,"correct_answer":["A"],"rationale":"<p>Choice A is correct. The given expression <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/60fdb4d4/img_005_888bd5d1.png\" alt=\"open parenthesis, 2 x squared, minus 4, close parenthesis, minus, open parenthesis, negative 3, x squared, plus 2 x, minus 7, close parenthesis\"></span> can be rewritten as <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/60fdb4d4/img_006_ea9bd76e.png\" alt=\"2 x squared, minus 4, plus 3 x squared, minus 2 x, plus 7\"></span>. Combining like terms yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/60fdb4d4/img_007_fc8ea4e7.png\" alt=\"5 x squared, minus 2 x, plus 3\"></span>.<p>Choices B, C, and D are incorrect and may be the result of errors when applying the distributive property.</p><p><!--EndFragment--></p><p>&nbsp;</p></p>\n","answer_style":"Multiple Choice","section":"Math","image_count":8,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959629,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"60fdb4d4","skill_cd":"P.A.","score_band_range_cd":3,"skill_desc":"Equivalent expressions","createDate":1691007959629,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"05476-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"5748c5e6-3876-4b1d-a79c-98ffc2df4f01","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"05476-DC","section":"Math","prompt":"<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">Which expression is equivalent to <span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-c