<mn>31</mn>
<mn>3</mn>
</mfrac>
</math>. Note that 31/3 and 10.33 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"7028c74f","external_id":"c442bd01-c336-457a-a300-cc899742f16e","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"4b764a7c-c15b-4960-af80-c40664124df6","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.B.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables ","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":7,"type":"spr","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"5 left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis equals 15 left parenthesis x minus 17 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the sum of the solutions to the given equation?</p>","answerOptions":null,"keys":["10.33","31/3"],"correct_answer":["10.33","31/3"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"StartFraction 31 Over 3 EndFraction\"><mfrac>\n<mn>31</mn>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"5 left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis\"><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from each side of the given equation yields <math alttext=\"0 equals 15 left parenthesis x minus 17 right parenthesis left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis minus 5 left parenthesis x plus 7 right parenthesis\"><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn